<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fighting Staff</h1>
<p>A powerful weapon, the fighting staff is a full staff of hard wood, used 
in two hands: a stronger, better made cousin of the quarter staff.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla the fighting staff is fought with the quarterstaff skill, one 
of the polearms (see <a cmd='#'>Help Quarterstaff</a>): two-handed, it bludgeons, and 
it is a little better made than an ordinary quarter staff. Rangers can 
carve one from a fallen branch in the forest once they have mastered 
fashion weapon (see <a cmd='#'>Help Fashion Weapon</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
